---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="RSVP · Yuki Kakuno & Eleanor Ford"
  description="Please RSVP for the wedding of Yuki Kakuno & Eleanor Ford, 2 October 2027."
  noindex={true}
  hideHeader={true}
  ogImage="/images/wedding/wedding-invite-og.jpg"
  favicon="/images/wedding/rsvp-favicon.png"
>
  <div class="px-8 md:px-12 py-6 flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="/" class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">
      <img src="/studio-kaku-logo.png" alt="Studio Kaku" class="h-24 md:h-32 w-auto" />
    </a>
    <button
      class="lang-toggle text-xs tracking-widest uppercase border border-brand-border bg-brand-bg px-3 py-1.5 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity"
      onclick="toggleLang()"
    >日本語</button>
  </div>
  <style>
    .name-script {
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .form-divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-brand-border);
      margin: 2.5rem 0;
    }
    input[type="radio"] {
      accent-color: var(--color-brand-text);
    }

    /* Vertical timeline */
    .tl-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1.5rem 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .tl-time {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--color-brand-muted);
      text-align: right;
      padding-right: 0.75rem;
      padding-top: 0.15rem;
      min-height: 1rem;
    }
    .tl-connector {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .tl-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--color-brand-accent);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
    .tl-dot-day {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--color-brand-accent);
      background: var(--color-brand-bg);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
    }
    .tl-line {
      width: 1px;
      background: var(--color-brand-border);
      flex: 1;
      min-height: 1.5rem;
    }
    .tl-content {
      padding-left: 0.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }
    .tl-event {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .tl-note {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--color-brand-muted);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
    .tl-day-label {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-brand-muted);
      padding-left: 0.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
      padding-top: 0.1rem;
    }
    .tl-illo {
      position: absolute;
      height: auto;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    /* Accommodation tables */
    .acc-table {
      width: 100%;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .acc-table th {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-brand-muted);
      font-weight: 400;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem 0.5rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-brand-border);
    }
    .acc-table td {
      padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem 0.6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-brand-border);
    }
    .acc-photo {
      background: var(--color-brand-border);
      color: var(--color-brand-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .acc-photo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    /* Info buttons */
    .info-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-brand-border);
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .info-btn:hover { border-color: var(--color-brand-text); }
    .info-btn.active {
      background: var(--color-brand-text);
      color: var(--color-brand-bg);
      border-color: var(--color-brand-text);
    }
    .info-panel {
      display: none;
      padding: 2rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-brand-border);
    }
    .info-panel.open { display: block; }
  </style>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="px-8 md:px-12 pt-16 md:pt-28 pb-16 text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-10" data-en="2 · 3 October 2027 · Shimoda, Japan" data-ja="2027年10月2日・3日 · 静岡県下田市">2 · 3 October 2027 · Shimoda, Japan</p>
    <h1 class="name-script leading-tight" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem); text-align: center;" data-en="Yuki Kakuno&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 0.7em;&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Eleanor Florence Pearce Ford" data-ja="角野友紀&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 0.7em;&quot;&gt;＆&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;エレノアフォード">
      Yuki Kakuno<br />
      <span style="font-size: 0.7em;">&amp;</span><br />
      Eleanor Florence Pearce Ford
    </h1>
    <p class="text-brand-muted mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed tracking-wide" data-en="We would like to invite you to our wedding!<br />Please let us know if you can join us." data-ja="私たちの結婚式にご招待いたします。<br />ご出欠のご返信をお願いいたします。">
      We would like to invite you to our wedding!<br />
      Please let us know if you can join us.
    </p>
    <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mt-10" data-en="Please RSVP by 1 March 2027" data-ja="2027年3月1日までにご返信ください">Please RSVP by 1 March 2027</p>
    <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs mt-6" data-en="Questions on the day? &lt;a href=&quot;https://wa.me/819066521550&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;Rachel, +81 90-6652-1550&lt;/a&gt; (WhatsApp) &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:hello@studio-kaku.com&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;hello@studio-kaku.com&lt;/a&gt;" data-ja="当日のご質問は &lt;a href=&quot;https://wa.me/819066521550&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;Rachel, +81 90-6652-1550&lt;/a&gt; (WhatsApp) &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:hello@studio-kaku.com&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;hello@studio-kaku.com&lt;/a&gt; まで">
      Questions on the day? <a href="https://wa.me/819066521550" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">Rachel, +81 90-6652-1550</a> <span class="normal-case">(WhatsApp)</span>
      &nbsp;·&nbsp;
      <a href="mailto:hello@studio-kaku.com" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">hello@studio-kaku.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Vertical timeline -->
  <section class="px-8 md:px-12 py-16 border-t border-brand-border" style="overflow-x: hidden;">
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <img id="tl-illo-desktop" src="/images/wedding/schedule-illustrations.png" alt="" class="hidden lg:block" style="position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:1280px; height:730px; z-index:0; pointer-events:none;" />
      <img id="tl-illo-mobile" src="/images/wedding/schedule-illustrations-mobile.png" alt="" class="lg:hidden" style="position:absolute; left:50%; top:0; transform:translateX(-50%); width:350px; max-width:none; height:746px; z-index:0; pointer-events:none;" />
      <div id="tl-column" class="max-w-xs mx-auto relative" style="z-index:1;">

      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-sat-label">
        <div class="tl-time"></div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot-day"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-day-label" data-en="Saturday 2 October 2027&lt;span style=&quot;display:block;margin-top:0.2rem;color:var(--color-brand-accent);letter-spacing:0.06em;&quot;&gt;Smart / Casual&lt;/span&gt;" data-ja="2027年10月2日（土）&lt;span style=&quot;display:block;margin-top:0.2rem;color:var(--color-brand-accent);letter-spacing:0.06em;&quot;&gt;スマート・カジュアル&lt;/span&gt;">Saturday 2 October 2027<span style="display:block;margin-top:0.2rem;color:var(--color-brand-accent);letter-spacing:0.06em;">Smart / Casual</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-arrival">
        <div class="tl-time">3:00pm</div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Arrival by 3pm" data-ja="15時までに到着">Arrival by 3pm</p>
          <p class="tl-note" data-en="&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/3esAWPnSevyEWgJfA&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;Shirahama Shrine ↗&lt;/a&gt; · parking available but limited" data-ja="&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/3esAWPnSevyEWgJfA&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;白浜神社 ↗&lt;/a&gt; ・駐車場あり（台数に限りがあります）"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/3esAWPnSevyEWgJfA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">Shirahama Shrine ↗</a> · parking available but limited</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-ceremony">
        <div class="tl-time">3:30pm</div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Wedding" data-ja="挙式">Wedding</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-shuttle">
        <div class="tl-time">4:30pm</div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Shuttle buses depart" data-ja="シャトルバス出発">Shuttle buses depart</p>
          <p class="tl-note" data-en="to Garden Villa Hotel, buses will run back and forth so everyone gets collected" data-ja="ガーデンヴィラホテルへ。全員が乗車できるよう往復運行します">to Garden Villa Hotel, buses will run back and forth so everyone gets collected</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-aperitivo">
        <div class="tl-time">5:00pm</div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Aperitivo" data-ja="アペリティーボ">Aperitivo</p>
          <p class="tl-note" data-en="&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/hiNQoJXh1pRR5Db6A&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;Garden Villa Hotel ↗&lt;/a&gt; · if parking, take the first entrance (follow signs to BBQ Garden)" data-ja="&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/hiNQoJXh1pRR5Db6A&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;ガーデンヴィラホテル ↗&lt;/a&gt; ・お車の場合は第一入口へ（BBQガーデンの案内表示に従ってください）"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/hiNQoJXh1pRR5Db6A" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">Garden Villa Hotel ↗</a> · if parking, take the first entrance (follow signs to BBQ Garden)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-dinner">
        <div class="tl-time">7:00pm</div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Dinner &amp;amp; Party" data-ja="ディナー・パーティー">Dinner &amp; Party</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-lasttaxi">
        <div class="tl-time">1:00am</div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Last taxi for non-hotel guests" data-ja="宿泊されない方の最終タクシー">Last taxi for non-hotel guests</p>
          <p class="tl-note" data-en="please arrange your own taxi by this time" data-ja="この時間までにタクシーの手配をお願いします">please arrange your own taxi by this time</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sunday -->
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-sun-label" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        <div class="tl-time"></div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot-day"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-day-label" data-en="Sunday 3 October 2027&lt;span style=&quot;display:block;margin-top:0.2rem;color:var(--color-brand-accent);letter-spacing:0.06em;&quot;&gt;Casual / Swimsuit&lt;/span&gt;" data-ja="2027年10月3日（日）&lt;span style=&quot;display:block;margin-top:0.2rem;color:var(--color-brand-accent);letter-spacing:0.06em;&quot;&gt;カジュアル・水着&lt;/span&gt;">Sunday 3 October 2027<span style="display:block;margin-top:0.2rem;color:var(--color-brand-accent);letter-spacing:0.06em;">Casual / Swimsuit</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-beach">
        <div class="tl-time"></div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Beach Party &amp;amp; Snorkelling" data-ja="ビーチパーティー・シュノーケリング">Beach Party &amp; Snorkelling</p>
          <p class="tl-note" data-en="&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/T6B1yC5p9FaUyazN7&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;The beach ↗&lt;/a&gt; · lunch and drinks" data-ja="&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/T6B1yC5p9FaUyazN7&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; class=&quot;underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity&quot;&gt;ビーチ ↗&lt;/a&gt; ・ランチとお飲み物"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/T6B1yC5p9FaUyazN7" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">The beach ↗</a> · lunch and drinks</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item" id="tl-transport">
        <div class="tl-time"></div>
        <div class="tl-connector"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-line" style="visibility:hidden;"></div></div>
        <div class="tl-content">
          <p class="tl-event" data-en="Transportation" data-ja="交通手段">Transportation</p>
          <p class="tl-note" data-en="from the hotel to the station, or back to Garden Villa Hotel if you're staying Sunday night" data-ja="ホテルから駅まで、または日曜日もご宿泊の場合はガーデンヴィラホテルまでお送りします">from the hotel to the station, or back to Garden Villa Hotel if you're staying Sunday night</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Info buttons -->
  <section class="px-8 md:px-12 py-12 border-t border-brand-border">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
      <button class="info-btn" data-panel="taxi" data-en="Taxi Recommendations" data-ja="タクシーのご案内">Taxi Recommendations</button>
      <button class="info-btn" data-panel="spots" data-en="Favourite Shimoda Spots" data-ja="下田のおすすめスポット">Favourite Shimoda Spots</button>
      <button class="info-btn" data-panel="other" data-en="Other Questions" data-ja="その他のご質問">Other Questions</button>
      <button class="info-btn" data-panel="access" data-en="Access" data-ja="アクセス">Access</button>
    </div>
    <div id="panel-taxi" class="info-panel">
      <div class="max-w-lg">
        <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">Taxi Recommendations &nbsp;·&nbsp; タクシー</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mb-8" data-en="There is a taxi stand outside Izukyu Shimoda Station. You can also call ahead using the numbers below." data-ja="伊豆急下田駅の外にタクシー乗り場があります。以下の番号に事前にお電話いただくこともできます。">There is a taxi stand outside Izukyu Shimoda Station. You can also call ahead using the numbers below.</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1">伊豆東海タクシー <span class="font-normal text-brand-muted">(Izu Tokai Taxi)</span></p>
            <a href="tel:0558230129" class="text-sm text-brand-muted hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">0558-23-0129</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1">Eikyo Taxi</p>
            <a href="tel:0558232288" class="text-sm text-brand-muted hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">0558-23-2288</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1">Hifumi Taxis <span class="font-normal text-brand-muted">一二三タクシー</span></p>
            <a href="tel:0558220273" class="text-sm text-brand-muted hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">0558-22-0273</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-8 border-t border-brand-border pt-5" data-en="Taxis in Shimoda are limited late at night, so if you are not staying at Garden Villa Hotel, please arrange your taxi by 1:00am." data-ja="下田では深夜のタクシーの台数が限られています。ガーデンヴィラホテルにご宿泊でない方は、午前1時までにタクシーの手配をお願いします。">Taxis in Shimoda are limited late at night, so if you are not staying at Garden Villa Hotel, please arrange your taxi by 1:00am.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="panel-spots" class="info-panel">
      <div class="space-y-14">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between flex-wrap gap-4">
          <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase" data-en="Our Favourite Shimoda Spots" data-ja="下田のおすすめスポット">Our Favourite Shimoda Spots</p>
          <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/onx5XNNApwMwHCmZ7" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity" data-en="View All On One Map ↗" data-ja="すべてを地図で見る ↗">View All On One Map ↗</a>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-6" style="color:var(--color-brand-text);" data-en="Onsen &amp;amp; Baths" data-ja="温泉・お風呂">Onsen &amp; Baths</p>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
            <div>
              <div class="acc-photo"><img src="/images/wedding/spots/sawada-onsen.jpg" alt="Sawada Park Open-Air Onsen" /></div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/wm7ZSeaEh77KK1b17" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">Sawada Park Open-Air Onsen ↗</a></p>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs leading-relaxed" data-en="Open-air baths right above the sea, out in Nishiizu and worth the drive." data-ja="西伊豆にある、海のすぐ上に広がる露天風呂。少し遠出する価値ありです。">Open-air baths right above the sea, out in Nishiizu and worth the drive.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="acc-photo"><img src="/images/wedding/spots/yama-no-ie.jpg" alt="Yama no Ie" /></div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Yhh6UrVjk4HQR1pV6" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">Yama no Ie ↗</a></p>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs leading-relaxed" data-en="A rustic riverside spot in the forest, reached over a little wooden bridge." data-ja="森の中、小さな木の橋を渡った先にある川沿いの素朴なスポット。">A rustic riverside spot in the forest, reached over a little wooden bridge.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="acc-photo"><img src="/images/wedding/spots/stone-sauna.jpg" alt="Stone Sauna & Bath" /></div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/PQ3UKTLfiiJA99GT6" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">Stone Sauna &amp; Bath ↗</a></p>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs leading-relaxed" data-en="Lie out on heated pebbles in a robe, a good one to slow right down in." data-ja="ガウン姿で温めた石の上に横になれる、心身ともにゆったりできる場所。">Lie out on heated pebbles in a robe, a good one to slow right down in.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="acc-photo"><img src="/images/wedding/spots/kannon-onsen.jpg" alt="Kannon Onsen" /></div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium mb-1">Kannon Onsen <span class="font-normal text-brand-muted">観音温泉</span></p>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs leading-relaxed" data-en="A quieter local onsen, a little further out of town." data-ja="町から少し離れた、落ち着いた雰囲気の地元の温泉。">A quieter local onsen, a little further out of town.</p>
